              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2022-1705?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.17.12",
              "help": {
                "text": "The HTTP/1 client accepted some invalid Transfer-Encoding headers as indicating a \"chunked\" encoding. This could potentially allow for request smuggling, but only if combined with an intermediate server that also improperly failed to reject the header as invalid.\n",
                "markdown": "> The HTTP/1 client accepted some invalid Transfer-Encoding headers as indicating a \"chunked\" encoding. This could potentially allow for request smuggling, but only if combined with an intermediate server that also improperly failed to reject the header as invalid.\n\n|                                        |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.17  |\n|Affected range  <1.17.12                |\n|Fixed version   1.17.12                 |\n"
