              "help": {
                "text": "The HTTP/1 client does not fully validate the contents of the Host header. A maliciously crafted Host header can inject additional headers or entire requests.\n\nWith fix, the HTTP/1 client now refuses to send requests containing an invalid Request.Host or Request.URL.Host value.\n",
                "markdown": "> The HTTP/1 client does not fully validate the contents of the Host header. A maliciously crafted Host header can inject additional headers or entire requests.\n\nWith fix, the HTTP/1 client now refuses to send requests containing an invalid Request.Host or Request.URL.Host value.\n\n|                                        |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.17  |\n|Affected range  <1.19.11                |\n|Fixed version   1.19.11                 |\n"
