                "markdown": "> Calling File.ImportedSymbols on a loaded file which contains an invalid dynamic symbol table command can cause a panic, in particular if the encoded number of undefined symbols is larger than the number of symbols in the symbol table.\n\n|                                        |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.17  |\n|Affected range  >=1.17.0-0,<1.17.3      |\n|Fixed version   1.17.3                  |\n"
              },
